					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12931880#post-4470073</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12931880/scp-5000-j#post-4470073</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2020 02:59:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>not_a_seagull</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3009022</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I’m upvoting for three reasons:</p> <p>1). I found it genuinely funny. That rhyme is still stuck in my head, after all of these years.</p> <p>2). The gimmick that I use in my author page is finally in an actual SCP.</p> <p>3). It reminds me of when I was 8 and I wrote a C# interface that accepted some text and then opened a message box that said &quot;&lt;text entered&gt; is Agent Bob’s secret identity”. My best friend and I then proceeded to stay up all night putting the most childish stuff through that program and laughing.</p> <p>Edit: You can make the link the usual color by adding this to your css:</p> <div class="code"> <pre> <code>a { color: #b01; text-decoration: none; background: transparent; } a:hover { text-decoration: underline; background-color: transparent; }</code> </pre></div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12931880#post-4469927</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12931880/scp-5000-j#post-4469927</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2020 00:47:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DesertMoonGW</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1439663</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>+1 This really reads like an SCP Cards Against Humanity round.</p> <p>Black Card: SCP-5000-J is considered uncontained until Foundation Agents get to the bottom of who took the cookie. Was it [BLANK]? Couldn't be! Then Who?</p> <p>Your hand:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>1. the entire contents of the SCP-914 test log<br /> 2. Director Moose, herding cats<br /> 3. Dr. Bright, looking for a late night snack<br /> 4. Sir Caliban, fifth knight of the fuck stick league<br /> 5. SCP-682<br /> 6. Dr. Kiryu, to feed the butterflies<br /> 7. one of the many, many Ralph Rogets we can't get rid of<br /> 8. that son of a bitch Jim Henson<br /> 9. Darkblade, with infinite angst<br /> 10. Joey Fucknuts, believing in himself</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
